/*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The following section contains the PM_UTIL package history
   From version 3.0.0 onwards we start a new history because of
   major changes in the underlaying power and thermal management.
   From UGW8 onwards we are using the Linux PM + Linux Thermal FW.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

pm_util version_4.4.2 2023_09_01
=================================
- task Jira ID PMCPESYS-827
   enhance the logger functionality
   add EOH, EOD, improve runtime and fix ctrl-c interruption of pm_util.
   socket was blocked for 2min's; add signal handling
   add TOP_NOC, PCIE_ASPM, WiFi, Ethernet status information
   add Ethernet/WiFi throughput counters

pm_util version_4.4.1 2023_07_24
=================================
- task Jira ID PMCPESYS-802
   some of the sysfs filenames changed from 4.19 to 5.15 kernel evrsion
   add additional EOH and EOD marker for better parsing on socket client side 

