pm_util version_4.3.2 2022_10_03
=================================
- bugfix Jira ID PMCPESYS-638
   pm_util show incorrect p34 version number

pm_util version_4.3.1 2022_9_16
=================================
- new feature Jira ID PMCPESYS-636
   Support new power monitor devices on Octopus board
   LTC2945 from Analog Devices

pm_util version_4.3.0 2022_7_7
=================================
- new feature Jira ID PMCPESYS-574
   pm_util: add socket support for paramter logging. Instead of logging into
   file we send the data to a socket. An available python tool listen to
   this socket and create real time graph of this paramters, e.g junction
   temperatures, power consuption, cpu frequeny, ...
- bugfix Jira ID PMCPESYS-553
   pm_util: compatibility fixes for LGM, GRX, PRX platforms

pm_util version_4.2.10 2022_5_27
=================================
- bugfix Jira ID PMCPESYS-581
   pm_util: fix Pvt_Monitor display with pm_util -a; CPUM0/CPUM1 are reversed

