pm_util version_4.2.0 2020_12_17
================================= 
- new feature Jira ID PMCPESYS-326
   display EPU PM Device Status and ADP PM Status
- new feature Jira ID PMCPESYS-298
   add scaling_cur_freq and scaling_max_freq when cpu frequency is printed
   add new option -d to get and set C-States-disable per core or for all cores
   add new option -m to get and set the max cpu frequency per core or for all cores
   modify the -f and -g option to change a single core or all cores

